  "summary": "Rylan Mills is a right-handed hitting catcher drafted by the Milwaukee Brewers in the 18th round (545th overall) of the 2025 MLB Draft out of Oran High School in Missouri. He signed for $247,500 and was initially committed to Southeast Missouri State University. Mills has displayed significant raw power with high exit velocities and long home runs in pre-draft showcases. He is currently playing in the Brewers' rookie league system (ACL Brewers, Wilson Warbirds).",
